      "description": {
        "fun": "Gible is a little land shark whose mouth is far bigger than its stomach. Its kind once lived in the tropics, so it hides in caves warmed by geothermal heat and leaps out to chomp anything that moves. All that clumsy biting chips its teeth, but new ones grow back within days. One Pokédex warns that if you live with a Gible, your heating bill will soar.",
        "guide": "Gible is a Dragon- and Ground-type Pokémon resembling a small land shark. It lives in caves warmed by geothermal heat and ambushes prey with its huge mouth, and its teeth regrow when they break. It evolves into Gabite and then Garchomp.",
        "tagline": "A clumsy little land shark that bites first.",
        "sources": [
          {
