      },
      "description": {
        "fun": "Gabite loves anything that sparkles: it digs up gems as it expands its nest and can sit for ages gazing at its hoard, like a dragon of European legend. One Pokédex entry tells of a violent Gabite turning docile when handed a glass bead it had been eyeing. Its shed scales are prized for traditional medicine, long believed to cure even incurable illnesses.",
        "guide": "Gabite is the evolved form of Gible, a Dragon- and Ground-type cave dweller that hoards gems in its nest. Its scales are believed to have medicinal properties, and it navigates dark caves using ultrasonic waves. It evolves into Garchomp.",
        "tagline": "A treasure-hoarding cave dragon you can bribe with a glass bead.",
