      "description": {
        "fun": "Fold in its fins and Garchomp looks like a jet plane, and it flies like one too, hunting at the speed of sound and never letting prey escape. Its design mixes sharks, dinosaurs and fighter planes, perhaps nodding to the shark-mouthed noses painted on Warhawk fighters. Designed by Takao Unno, it is one of the few Pokémon with two Mega Evolutions.",
        "guide": "Garchomp is the final form of Gible, a Dragon- and Ground-type Pokémon combining a shark with a jet plane. It can fly at the speed of sound and lives in volcanic mountains. It can Mega Evolve into Mega Garchomp or, since the Mega Dimension expansion of Pokémon Legends: Z-A, Mega Garchomp Z.",
        "tagline": "A jet-powered land shark that never lets prey escape.",
        "sources": [
          {
